"left:220px;top:760px\"></div><div class=\"node\" style=\"left:820px;top:470px\"></div>\n<div class=\"node\" style=\"left:1420px;top:700px\"></div><div class=\"node hi\" style=\"left:1760px;top:420px\"></div>\n<div class=\"lab\" style=\"left:220px;top:590px\"><i>01</i><b>결과물</b></div>\n<div class=\"lab\" style=\"left:820px;top:300px\"><i>02</i><b>스케치</b></div>\n<div class=\"lab\" style=\"left:1420px;top:530px\"><i>03</i><b>아이디어</b></div>\n<div class=\"lab\" style=\"left:1600px;top:250px\"><i>04</i><b>리서치</b></div>\n<div class=\"runner\"></div>\n</div></div>",
